# Hot reload R1 (SparksReload LC7a): a new revision is a new linked module; instances, connections
# and the session module move to it; Cancel cancels executions with a changed function on their
# frames (a cancelled Start runs again), Keep leaves them on the previous revision; the Tick stop of
# the module is lifted; class removal, base and layout changes are rejected without changes.
